            <h1 class="text-[32px] md:text-[44px] font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-[1.05]">Self Credit Builder Review 2026 — Does It Really Build Savings <span class="text-emerald-500">+ Credit?</span></h1>
            <p class="mt-4 text-[17px] leading-7 text-slate-600 max-w-[680px]">Self's Credit Builder Account is a US-only installment loan that locks your payments into a CD. It reports to all 3 bureaus, helps establish payment history, and gives you your money back minus fees. We break down how it works, $25-$150 plans, hidden costs, and who should skip it.</p>

            <!-- Author Box -->
            <div class="mt-8 rounded-[16px] border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/70 p-4 md:p-5 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4 items-start">
