                    </div>
                    <div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-[13px]">
                        <span class="font-bold text-slate-900">Reviewed by Dr. James L., CFA</span>
                        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 text-[11px]">✓ Fact-checked Oct 20, 2026</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="mt-2 text-[12px] leading-6 text-slate-500">Methodology: We analyzed Self's plan disclosure, Lead Bank CD agreement, fee schedule, CFPB guidance on credit-builder loans, and consumer complaints. Sources: <a href="https://www.consumerfinance.gov/ask-cfpb/what-is-a-credit-builder-loan-en-1813/" class="underline">CFPB</a>, <a href="https://www.experian.com/blogs/ask-experian/credit-builder-loans/" class="underline">Experian</a>, <a href="https://www.equifax.com/personal/education/credit-score/articles/what-is-a-credit-builder-loan/" class="underline">Equifax</a>. No personal data required for our calculators.</p>
